{
  "project": {
    "name": "Bolero",
    "slug": "bolero",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "The cropped open bolero (shrug jacket): a very short, open-front jacket ending above the waist, with curved fronts that meet only at the top (no closure) and grown sleeves — worn over a dress or top for the shoulders and arms. Distinct from FC-100's hip-length button cardigan. Front and back share the body width so the shoulder, side, and underarm seams balance. A soft-goods garment — no hardware. FC-200 long-tail (layer gap).\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "El bolero corto abierto (shrug): una chaqueta muy corta de frente abierto que termina sobre la cintura, con frentes curvos que se juntan solo arriba (sin cierre) y mangas nacidas — para llevar sobre un vestido o top, cubriendo hombros y brazos. Distinto del cárdigan a la cadera con botones de FC-100. Frente y espalda comparten el ancho del cuerpo, así que las costuras de hombro, lateral y bajo manga se equilibran. Una prenda textil — sin herrajes. Cola larga FC-200 (hueco de capa).\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet",
      "fr": "Le boléro court ouvert (shrug) : une veste très courte à devant ouvert s'arrêtant au-dessus de la taille, avec des devants incurvés qui ne se rejoignent qu'en haut (sans fermeture) et des manches coupées à même — portée sur une robe ou un top, pour les épaules et les bras. Distinct du cardigan boutonné à hauteur de hanche de FC-100. Devant et dos partagent la largeur du corps, donc les coutures d'épaule, latérale et de dessous de bras s'équilibrent. Un vêtement textile — sans quincaillerie. Longue traîne FC-200 (manque couche).\n\nVisualiseur et configurateur officiel : Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "bolero",
      "shrug",
      "cropped",
      "open-front",
      "layer",
      "commons",
      "made-to-measure"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "modes": [
    {
      "id": "set",
      "label": {
        "en": "Full Bolero",
        "es": "Bolero completo",
        "fr": "Boléro complet"
      },
      "script_file": "main.py",
      "pieces": [
        "front",
        "back"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pieces": [
    {
      "id": "front",
      "label": {
        "en": "Front (open curve)",
        "es": "Frente (curva abierta)",
        "fr": "Devant (courbe ouverte)"
      },
      "default_color": "#6a4a5a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 2,
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "back",
      "label": {
        "en": "Back",
        "es": "Espalda",
        "fr": "Dos"
      },
      "default_color": "#6a4a5a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameter_groups": [
    {
      "id": "body",
      "label": {
        "en": "Body Measurements",
        "es": "Medidas Corporales",
        "fr": "Mesures du corps"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fit",
      "label": {
        "en": "Fit & Style",
        "es": "Ajuste y Estilo",
        "fr": "Coupe et style"
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameters": [
    {
      "id": "chest_girth",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "body",
      "default": 960,
      "min": 660,
      "max": 1500,
      "step": 10,
      "measurement": {
        "standard": "iso_8559",
        "code": "chest_bust_girth"
      },
      "label": {
        "en": "Chest girth (mm)",
        "es": "Contorno de pecho (mm)",
        "fr": "Tour de poitrine (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "Full chest",
        "es": "Pecho completo",
        "fr": "Poitrine complète"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bolero_length",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "body",
      "default": 340,
      "min": 220,
      "max": 480,
      "step": 10,
      "label": {
        "en": "Length (mm)",
        "es": "Largo (mm)",
        "fr": "Longueur (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "Nape to cropped hem",
        "es": "De la nuca al ruedo corto",
        "fr": "De la nuque à l'ourlet court"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "neck_width",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "fit",
      "default": 200,
      "min": 150,
      "max": 340,
      "step": 5,
      "label": {
        "en": "Neck width (mm)",
        "es": "Ancho de cuello (mm)",
        "fr": "Largeur d'encolure (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "Neck opening",
        "es": "Abertura de cuello",
        "fr": "Ouverture d'encolure"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sleeve_grown",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "fit",
      "default": 260,
      "min": 80,
      "max": 420,
      "step": 10,
      "label": {
        "en": "Sleeve length (mm)",
        "es": "Largo de manga (mm)",
        "fr": "Longueur de manche (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "Grown sleeve length",
        "es": "Largo de manga nacida",
        "fr": "Longueur de manche coupée à même"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sleeve_depth",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "fit",
      "default": 150,
      "min": 100,
      "max": 240,
      "step": 10,
      "label": {
        "en": "Sleeve height (mm)",
        "es": "Alto de manga (mm)",
        "fr": "Hauteur de manche (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "Grown sleeve height at cuff",
        "es": "Alto de manga nacida en el puño",
        "fr": "Hauteur de manche au poignet"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "front_curve",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "fit",
      "default": 140,
      "min": 60,
      "max": 260,
      "step": 10,
      "label": {
        "en": "Front curve (mm)",
        "es": "Curva del frente (mm)",
        "fr": "Courbe du devant (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "How deep the open front curves away",
        "es": "Cuánto se curva el frente abierto",
        "fr": "Profondeur de la courbe du devant ouvert"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ease",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "fit",
      "default": 120,
      "min": 40,
      "max": 320,
      "step": 10,
      "label": {
        "en": "Fit ease (mm)",
        "es": "Holgura (mm)",
        "fr": "Aisance (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "Fit ease",
        "es": "Holgura de ajuste",
        "fr": "Aisance de coupe"
      }
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "id": "classic",
      "label": {
        "en": "Classic",
        "es": "Clásico",
        "fr": "Classique"
      },
      "values": {
        "front_curve": 140
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cropped",
      "label": {
        "en": "Extra cropped",
        "es": "Extra corto",
        "fr": "Très court"
      },
      "values": {
        "bolero_length": 260,
        "front_curve": 100
      }
    }
  ],
  "export_formats": [
    "svg",
    "dxf",
    "json"
  ],
  "fabrics": [],
  "hyperobject": {
    "is_hyperobject": true,
    "domain": "garment",
    "interfaces": [
      {
        "id": "shoulder_seam",
        "type": "shoulder",
        "label": {
          "en": "Shoulder seam",
          "es": "Costura de hombro",
          "fr": "Couture d'épaule"
        },
        "edges": [
          {
            "piece": "front",
            "edge": "shoulder"
          },
          {
            "piece": "back",
            "edge": "shoulder"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          "neck_width",
          "chest_girth"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "side_seam",
        "type": "side_seam",
        "label": {
          "en": "Side seam",
          "es": "Costura lateral",
          "fr": "Couture latérale"
        },
        "edges": [
          {
            "piece": "front",
            "edge": "side"
          },
          {
            "piece": "back",
            "edge": "side"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          "chest_girth",
          "ease"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "underarm",
        "type": "armscye",
        "label": {
          "en": "Sleeve underarm",
          "es": "Bajo manga",
          "fr": "Dessous de manche"
        },
        "edges": [
          {
            "piece": "front",
            "edge": "sleeve_under"
          },
          {
            "piece": "back",
            "edge": "sleeve_under"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          "sleeve_grown",
          "sleeve_depth"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "capabilities": {
      "made_to_measure": true,
      "fold_cutting": true,
      "fabric_compensation": false
    },
    "societal_benefit": {
      "en": "An open, made-to-measure bolero adds warmth and coverage to a sleeveless dress from a tiny amount of cloth and no fastenings, so a versatile layer is makeable and mendable by anyone and pairs with garments they already own.",
      "es": "Un bolero abierto y a la medida añade abrigo y cobertura a un vestido sin mangas con muy poca tela y sin cierres, para que una capa versátil sea fabricable y reparable por cualquiera y combine con prendas que ya se tienen.",
      "fr": "Un boléro ouvert et sur mesure ajoute chaleur et couverture à une robe sans manches à partir d'une très petite quantité de tissu et sans fermeture, de sorte qu'une couche polyvalente soit fabricable et réparable par tous et s'accorde avec des vêtements que l'on possède déjà."
    },
    "commons_license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0"
  }
}
